00:17:55.641 --> 00:17:56.475
PROFESSOR OF ANATOMY AND

00:17:56.542 --> 00:17:59.745
NEUROBIOLOGY. HE WAS A LEADER IN

00:17:59.812 --> 00:18:00.846
HIS FIELD WITH EXTENSIVE

00:18:00.913 --> 00:18:02.281
KNOWLEDGE OF THE PATHWAYS OF THE

00:18:02.347 --> 00:18:04.082
