00:18:05.851 --> 00:18:06.919
PRESENCE OF STEM CELLS IN THE

00:18:06.985 --> 00:18:08.687
INJURED ADULT BRAIN. HIS

00:18:08.754 --> 00:18:09.121
RESEARCH ENCOMPASSES

00:18:09.188 --> 00:18:12.257
SCHIZOPHRENIA, PARKINSON'S

00:18:12.324 --> 00:18:12.858
DISEASE, ALZHEIMER'S DISEASE,

00:18:12.925 --> 00:18:15.594
ADDICTION, MENTAL HEALTH,

00:18:15.661 --> 00:18:16.562
LANGUAGE DISORDERS, AND MAGNETIC

00:18:16.628 --> 00:18:19.064
RESONANCE IMAGING. HIS WORK ALSO

00:18:19.131 --> 00:18:20.799
DELVED INTO THE REALMS OF

00:18:20.866 --> 00:18:22.267
PERSONALITY, INTELLIGENCE,

00:18:22.334 --> 00:18:22.801
CONSCIOUSNESS, ANESTHESIA,

00:18:22.868 --> 00:18:25.504
SLEEP, EMOTIONAL MEMORY, AND THE

00:18:25.571 --> 00:18:28.474
MODELING OF NEURAL CIRCUITS. HE

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:29.541
AUTHORED OVER 300 PAPERS IN

00:18:29.608 --> 00:18:31.944
BOOKS. JIM SERVED ON A WIDE

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:33.078
VARIETY OF BOOKS OF BOARDS AND

00:18:33.145 --> 00:18:34.079
COMMITTEES, INCLUDING THE

00:18:34.146 --> 00:18:35.714
