THROUGH AN ANOMALY THAT HE

00:18:47.459 --> 00:18:49.294
SERENDIPITY HE DISCOVERED DURING

00:18:49.361 --> 00:18:52.364
A RESEARCH PROJECT THAT FOREVER

00:18:52.431 --> 00:18:55.367
CHANGED HIS LIFE. IN 2005, WHILE

00:18:55.434 --> 00:18:56.368
