00:18:56.435 --> 00:18:58.770
BRAIN SCANS OF HIS HEALTHY

00:18:58.837 --> 00:18:59.805
FAMILY MEMBERS AS A CONTROL

00:18:59.872 --> 00:19:02.474
WHILE SIMULTANEOUSLY REVIEWING

00:19:02.541 --> 00:19:03.475
THE MRIS OF MURDEROUS

00:19:03.542 --> 00:19:05.844
PSYCHOPATHS FOR ANOTHER PROJECT.

00:19:05.911 --> 00:19:08.881
THE RESULTS SEEMED TO INDICATE

00:19:08.947 --> 00:19:10.048
THAT ONE OF THE KILLER'S SCANS

00:19:10.115 --> 00:19:12.518
HAD BEEN MISTAKENLY SHUFFLED

00:19:12.584 --> 00:19:13.585
INTO THE BATCH WITH HIS OWN

00:19:13.652 --> 00:19:15.821
FAMILY SCANS, BUT AS IT TURNED

00:19:15.888 --> 00:19:17.689
OUT, NO MISTAKE HAD BEEN MADE.

00:19:17.756 --> 00:19:19.091
THE BRAIN SCAN THAT MIRRORED

00:19:19.157 --> 00:19:20.092
THOSE OF THE PSYCHOPATHIC

00:19:20.158 --> 00:19:23.495
MURDERERS WAS, IN FACT, HIS VERY

00:19:23.562 --> 00:19:25.764
OWN BRAIN. THIS PROMPTED JIM TO

00:19:25.831 --> 00:19:26.965
DELVE INTO HIS FAMILY TREE AND

00:19:27.032 --> 00:19:29.134
SPEAK WITH EXPERTS, COLLEAGUES,

00:19:29.201 --> 00:19:29.902
RELATIVES AND FRIENDS.

00:19:29.968 --> 00:19:32.838
ULTIMATELY, HIS RESEARCH LED HIM

00:19:32.905 --> 00:19:33.939
TO CATEGORIZE HIMSELF AS A

00:19:34.006 --> 00:19:36.341
PRO-SOCIAL PSYCHOPATH. HIS

00:19:36.408 --> 00:19:37.409
STUDIES LED TO A BETTER

00:19:37.476 --> 00:19:39.411
UNDERSTANDING OF PSYCHOPATHS,

